is-ancestor origin/master HEAD` exit 0, no rebase needed; reran `go test`/`go vet` on final revision, both 0.\n- Payload `/tmp/forest-review-canopy-publication-primary-refresh.json` (outside repo): `{\"schema\":\"forest.review-request.v2\",\"subject\":\"canopy-publication-primary-refresh\",\"branch\":\"forest/canopy-publication-primary-refresh/primary-refresh\",\"revision\":\"eebc1cc9968e3eb37715549d78fc9d0a233553a1\",\"time\":\"2026-09-04T20:22:39Z\",\"tracker\":\"powder\"}`.\n- `forest publish review-request builder <branch> <payload>`: `published review-request eebc1cc...`, exit 0. No `git push`/`notes`/force.\n- `gh pr create --head <branch>`: PR https://github.com/misty-step/canopy/pull/17, body names Powder job, no invented `Closes`. Did not call `powder done`.\n\n**Risks / unverified**\n- No Git races: ancestry verified pre-publish but later primary moves still possible — Verifier/Gate remains authority.\n- Job note records prior Verifier 402 on provider output ceiling (`if-provider-output-ceiling`); integration needs successful provider-backed Verifier Run — not locally verifiable, not claimed.\n- No credentials in files/commands/output; `master` untouched; work only in assigned worktree.\n"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"openrouter","model":"meta/muse-spark-1.3-contributor","usage":{"input":454,"output":1056,"cacheRead":40305,"cacheWrite":0,"reasoning":143,"totalTokens":41815,"cost":{"input":0.00043129999999999997,"output":0.0042239999999999995,"cacheRead":0.0064488,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.011104099999999999}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1788553371637,"responseId":"gen-1788553371-OKPIgtpf9sjsNBmqmzDL","rawStopReason":"stop"},"toolResults":[]}
